WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,230 --> 00:00:02,130
Brother

2
00:00:02,430 --> 00:00:04,430
It's Gao Jun who can't help you

3
00:00:05,090 --> 00:00:07,690
From now on, I will visit you every year and on holidays.

4
00:00:07,690 --> 00:00:10,090
If it doesn't work, I'll set up another memorial tablet for you.

5
00:00:10,090 --> 00:00:12,690
I will give you some food to buy from Li Ming

6
00:00:12,690 --> 00:00:13,690
If you believe me

7
00:00:13,690 --> 00:00:15,090
I will give you justice in this matter

8
00:00:15,090 --> 00:00:16,890
If Gao Jun is to die, just let him collect the money.

9
00:00:16,890 --> 00:00:18,890
You've really worn out his legs.

10
00:00:18,890 --> 00:00:20,090
He will suffer in the future

11
00:00:21,580 --> 00:00:22,780
He has another request

12
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:23,980
Want a house

13
00:00:23,980 --> 00:00:25,580
Wandering around the world with no place to stay

14
00:00:30,620 --> 00:00:32,420
The more I watch it in the future, I’ll become numb.

15
00:00:33,050 --> 00:00:34,450
They all say ghosts are scary

16
00:00:34,850 --> 00:00:42,740
But what’s even more frightening is the old man’s heart

17
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:44,140
That's other people's business

18
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:45,780
We can't control it

19
00:00:46,380 --> 00:00:48,390
Master Liu

20
00:00:48,390 --> 00:00:49,590
You said I have cysts

21
00:00:49,590 --> 00:00:50,790
I checked and it really does exist

22
00:00:50,790 --> 00:00:52,590
But I only told you this stuff because of you

23
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:53,990
Or do you think I only have it?

24
00:00:54,190 --> 00:00:56,190
Your ancestral graves were signed, right?

25
00:00:56,190 --> 00:00:59,190
Does it have anything to do with my ancestral graves?

26
00:00:59,190 --> 00:01:01,790
But it’s really not okay for your brain to have anything to do with ancestral graves.

27
00:01:01,790 --> 00:01:03,390
Next time I go to the hospital to get a brain exam.

28
00:01:04,390 --> 00:01:05,790
Go to a brain department
